      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Moderation API**\n\nI've decided to move forward with the Google Cloud Natural Language API for content moderation within `moderate_text.py`. The crucial step now is integrating it into the Python code and ensuring its use is clearly identifiable. I'm focusing on how best to structure the code to accommodate this integration cleanly.\n\n\n**Implementing Moderation Function**\n\nI'm now diving into the implementation details of `moderate_text.py`. I've settled on the Google Cloud Natural Language API. I will structure the code to import `google.cloud.language_v1`, create a `LanguageServiceClient`, and define a function `moderate_text(text: str)` that handles text moderation by utilizing the API's `moderate_text` method. I'm focusing on ensuring the input text is correctly formatted as a `Document` object for the API call.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
